  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Miss. Code § 97-37-3): A weapon so forfeited to a law enforcement agency may be sold at auction as provided by Sections 19-3-85 and 21-39-21 to a federally-licensed firearms dealer, with the proceeds from such sale at auction to be used by the seizing law enforcement agency in its discretion."
}